yunmai-noble-archive-keyring
============================

This package adds the Yunmai Noble APT repository:

  /usr/share/keyrings/yunmai-noble-archive-keyring.gpg
  /etc/apt/sources.list.d/yunmai-noble.sources

After installing it, refresh the package lists and install the application:

  sudo apt update
  sudo apt install yunmai-noble-full

The source file is a conffile, so local changes survive upgrades. Removing
the package removes both the source entry and the key.

Key rotation happens through a new version of this package. While a rotation
is in progress the keyring can contain both the old and the new key; do not
remove the old key until clients have upgraded.
